    {
      "chord_quality": "dom7alt",
      "function_role": "bebop-lick-extension-to-altered",
      "narrative": "The bebop lick can be deployed over dom7 chords to imply altered dominant sounds: 'Another interesting way to apply the bebop lick against dominant seventh chords is to use it as a means of playing tri-tone substitutions (or altered dominants), an element that will be taken up later in this book' (p. 44). This makes the bebop lick a gateway to altered harmony without requiring a full structural understanding of the altered dominant.",
